31:["$","p",null,{"children":["The failure mode worth knowing is that the two stores evict independently: a\nCAS eviction can leave an action cache entry pointing at blobs that no longer\nexist, so the client gets a hit and then fails to download it. That is what a\ncompleteness-checking store prevents, and\n",["$","$L6",null,{"href":"/operate/scaling-cas","children":"Scaling the CAS"}]," covers sizing."]}]
